From c70310c1a9dace419a68c4bcd89ba0bc7b6a40a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: minodori <minodori@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:10:15 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(mycobot_280_moveit2): add Octomap + hand-eye
 calibration integration

D435 point cloud now feeds MoveIt2's Octomap for real collision avoidance,
with the camera->joint6 transform provided by an easy_handeye2 eye-in-hand
calibration (previously a manually FK-computed static transform that had
to be recomputed for every arm pose).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
